[0.033, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mArea51 + Mend Intent\u001b[0m — open-source agent containment, enterprise behavioral verdicts\r\n\u001b[2m  Agent: support-refund-agent (customer data in its workspace, can run shell and npm).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m  Attack 1: a zero-day npm package — its postinstall steals credentials and data. No advisory exists yet.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Attack 2: a prompt-injected ticket tells the agent to print ~/.aws/credentials.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Same agent, same attacks, three setups.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.514, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m━━━ Setup: local Intent API, demo registry, attacker sink ━━━\u001b[0m\r\n"]
