[3.434, "o", "  Agent Gate: \u001b[32mPASS\u001b[0m (80/100)\r\n  Mend Intent: not configured (open-source mode)\r\n  Quarantine: not needed\r\n  Advisory scan (OSV-Scanner 2.7.0 + known-bad list): complete, 2 package(s), 0 advisory hit(s)\r\n  Runtime Policy: ALLOW via incus-container (risk 70/100)\r\n  Agent start: allowed\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m  OSV and the known-bad list have never heard of json-fast-format@1.4.2: advisories only know yesterday's malware.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m▸ Agent starts in the Area51 sandbox and installs its dependencies\u001b[0m\r\n"]
